<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Semiconductor equip makers started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Semiconductor equip makers started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co started coverage of PRI Automation Inc and KLA-Tencor Corp with outperform ratings, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer also started coverage of Etec Systems Inc with a market perform rating, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- PRI Automation was up 1/8 at 33-1/4, KLA was off 1-7/16 at 43-1/16 and Etec was up 1/4 at 37-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
